abstract: >-
  A single installable agent skill merging fourteen upstream academic-skills repositories,
  with a 28-part progressive-disclosure reference library, a dependency-free Python CLI
  exposing 21 commands, a 5,460-entry unified registry, eight audit gates including
  multi-signal retraction screening, PRISMA-S search logging, 2026 reporting-guideline
  routing and structured AI-use disclosure. Eight lossless and six curated SHA-256-verified
  archives preserve the source code. Validated against the Agent Skills open specification.
